">        if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (argc </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"prime needs an integer</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> cmd_prime</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">argv</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">strcmp</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">argv</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"table\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> cmd_table</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(argc </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\"> argv</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">strcmp</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">argv</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"guess\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (argc </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"guess needs a target</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> cmd_guess</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">argv</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"unknown mode: </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%s\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">argv</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>三个点自己对着看：<code>cmd_guess</code> 是 <code>while</code> + 三分支 + <code>break</code> 式提前返回；<code>cmd_table</code> 是双层 <code>for</code> 的 off-by-one（<code>j &lt;= i</code> 不是 <code>j &lt;= 9</code>）；<code>cmd_prime</code> 是 <code>for</code> 里的提前 <code>return</code>。猜数字这里用二分而不是随机数，是为了让输出可复现、能自动对拍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"36-跳转语义示例trapsc\">3.6 跳转语义示例：<code>traps.c</code></h3>\n<pre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"c\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">/* 故意不 break, 观察 case 穿透 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> switch_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"== switch fall-through ==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; k </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&lt;=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; k</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"case </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> -&gt; \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, k);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        switch</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (k) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"one \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"two \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"three \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">            default</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"done\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        putchar</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"-- with break --</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; k </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&lt;=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; k</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"case </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> -&gt; \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, k);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        switch</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (k) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"one\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);   </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"two\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);   </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">            case</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"three\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">            default</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"done\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        putchar</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> break_continue_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">== break vs continue ==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&lt;=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    putchar</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">/* while 里 continue 跳过自增会卡死, 用 guard 兜住 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> continue_trap</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">== continue trap in while ==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> guard </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        guard</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (guard </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">            printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\" guard fired: i stuck at </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%d\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">            break</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        i</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    putchar</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> do_while_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">== do-while runs at least once ==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    do</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">        printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"do-body with i=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%d\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"while(0) body: \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"never \"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">); i</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"(none)</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> short_circuit_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">== short circuit ==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (a </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) b </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"a=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> b=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">, no div-by-zero</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, a, b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (a </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) b </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"b=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">%d\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> dangling_else_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">== dangling else ==</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (y) </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"A</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"B</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"nothing above: else binds to inner if</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    switch_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    break_continue_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    continue_trap</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    do_while_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    short_circuit_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    dangling_else_demo</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre>\n<p><code>-Wall -Wextra</code> 下 <code>dangling_else_demo</code> 会报缩进误导的警告，<strong>故意留着</strong>：把警告抄进笔记，它就是 3.1 第 4 条的实物证据。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本机没有 C 编译器，上面两份代码已过 C11 语法解析校验；你在自己机器上按第 4 节命令实编译、实运行，输出以实跑为准。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"4-练习\">4. 练习</h2>\n<h3 id=\"41-编译并跑通三个程序\">4.1 编译并跑通三个程序</h3>\n<pre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> study/day03</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> &amp;&amp; </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> study/day03</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">gcc</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -std=c11</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -Wall</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -Wextra</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> flow.c</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> flow.exe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">gcc</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -std=c11</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -Wall</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -Wextra</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> traps.c</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> traps.exe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">./flow.exe</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> guess</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 37</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">./flow.exe</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> table</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">./flow.exe</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> prime</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 97</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">./traps.exe</span></span></code></pre>\n<p><code>guess 37</code> 应为 3 步命中；<code>table</code> 打印 9 行下三角；<code>prime 97</code> 输出 <code>97: prime</code>。<code>traps.exe</code> 里无 <code>break</code> 版的 case 1 应打印 <code>one two three done</code>。把四段输出整段抄进 <code>note.md</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"42-课表硬条件10-组边界输入逐条对答案\">4.2 课表硬条件：10 组边界输入逐条对答案</h3>\n<pre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 9</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 97</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> -7</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 2147483647</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">do</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> ./flow.exe</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> prime</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> $n; </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> -5</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 2147483648</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> abc</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 37</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">do</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> ./flow.exe</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> guess</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> $t; </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 9</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> -1</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> abc</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">do</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> ./flow.exe</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> $n; </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>素数 10 组期望输出（自己先手算再对）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>0</th>\n<th>1</th>\n<th>2</th>\n<th>3</th>\n<th>4</th>\n<th>9</th>\n<th>97</th>\n<th>100</th>\n<th>-7</th>\n<th>2147483647</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td>not</td>\n<td>not</td>\n<td>prime</td>\n<td>prime</td>\n<td>not</td>\n<td>not</td>\n<td>prime</td>\n<td>not</td>\n<td>not</td>\n<td>prime</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><code>2147483647 = 2^31-1</code> 是素数，<code>d &lt;= n/d</code> 在这里必须能正常终止，这是最大值边界的重点。</p>\n<p>猜数字期望：<code>0</code>、<code>-5</code>、<code>101</code>、<code>2147483648</code>、<code>abc</code> 全部给出可读的越界/非法提示且不崩；<code>1</code> 6 步、<code>2</code> 7 步、<code>50</code> 1 步、<code>100</code> 7 步、<code>37</code> 3 步命中。<code>2147483648</code> 在 <code>long long</code> 范围内能接住，走「out of range」分支。</p>\n<p>九九表期望：<code>table</code> 不带参数输出 9 行；<code>table 1</code> 输出 <code>1*1=1  </code>；<code>table 0</code>、<code>table 10</code>、<code>table -1</code>、<code>table abc</code> 都提示 <code>n must be in 1..9</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"43-改写成-for-与-do-while\">4.3 改写成 for 与 do-while</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>把 <code>cmd_guess</code> 的 <code>while (lo &lt;= hi)</code> 改成 <code>for (;;)</code> + 显式 <code>break</code>，输出必须和原版逐字一致（用 <code>diff</code> 对）。</li>\n<li>用 <code>do-while</code> 重写一遍「读入直到合法」的循环：<code>do { ... } while (bad);</code>，说清为什么这里 <code>do-while</code> 比 <code>while</code> 少一次重复读。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">./flow.exe</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> guess</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 37</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &gt;</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> a.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"># 改完重编译后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">./flow.exe</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> guess</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 37</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &gt;</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> b.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">diff</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> a.txt</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> b.txt</span></span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"44-手推循环不变式notemd-里写\">4.4 手推循环不变式（<code>note.md</code> 里写）</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>对 <code>guess 37</code>，逐轮列出 <code>lo / hi / mid / steps</code>，写出 5 行以内，末轮 <code>mid == 37</code>。</li>\n<li>用一句话写出不变式，并说明为什么 <code>lo = mid + 1</code>（不是 <code>mid</code>）能保证区间严格缩小、循环必然终止。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"5-产出清单必须落盘\">5. 产出清单（必须落盘）</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><code>study/day03/flow.c</code>（课表 <code>day03/flow.c</code> 指定产出）+ 三个程序的完整运行输出。</li>\n<li><code>study/day03/traps.c</code> + 输出记录。</li>\n<li><code>study/day03/note.md</code>：10 组边界输入对照表、<code>guess 37</code> 的循环不变式手推、<code>-Wall</code> 关于悬空 else 的警告摘录、学术雷达 3 行笔记。</li>\n<li><code>study/day03/a.txt</code> / <code>b.txt</code> 与 <code>diff</code> 结果（4.3 的改写对拍证据）。</li>\n<li>commit：<code>git add . &amp;&amp; git commit -m \"day03: branch, loop, prime/table/guess boundary tests\"</code>。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"6-检验标准5-条逐条回答过没过\">6. 检验标准（5 条，逐条回答过没过）</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>不看资料说出 <code>break</code> 与 <code>continue</code> 各跳到哪（尤其 <code>for</code> 与 <code>while</code> 的差别），以及 <code>do-while</code> 为何至少执行一次；能指出 <code>traps.c</code> 里那个 while 死循环卡在 <code>i=3</code> 的原因。过 / 没过：__。</li>\n<li>三个程序跑完 4.2 的 10 组边界输入，<code>0 / 1 / -7 / 2147483647 / abc</code> 全部不崩、不挂、输出与上表一致。过 / 没过：__。</li>\n<li>不看资料写出 <code>lo + (hi - lo) / 2</code> 和 <code>d &lt;= n / d</code>，并说明直接写 <code>(lo+hi)/2</code>、<code>d*d &lt;= n</code> 分别会在什么情况下溢出、后果是 UB 还是死循环。过 / 没过：__。</li>\n<li>说清 <code>switch</code> 的穿透规则，默写一个带 <code>default</code>、每个 <code>case</code> 都有 <code>break</code> 的版本；能解释 <code>traps.c</code> 中 case 1 为什么打印 <code>one two three done</code>。过 / 没过：__。</li>\n<li>说清 <code>=</code> 与 <code>==</code>、<code>&amp;&amp;</code>/<code>||</code> 的短路顺序、悬空 else 的配对规则，并解释 <code>if (a != 0 &amp;&amp; 10 / a &gt; 1)</code> 为什么不会除零。过 / 没过：__。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>5 条全过才进 D4。任一不过，明天不学新内容，先把今天补到过；连续 2 天没过，回头补 W1。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"7-明日预告\">7. 明日预告</h2>\n<p>明天 D4：函数、参数传递、作用域、递归，实现 gcd / 斐波那契 / 汉诺塔并画出 <code>fib(4)</code> 的完整调用树。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"8-收尾\">8. 收尾</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>打开 <code>看板.html</code>，把 Day 3 的 5 条检验逐条勾上（勾选自动存本地），W1 那格等周日周检再勾。</li>\n<li>当天检验没过，就不学新内容——总纲第 5 节和课表使用规则第 1 条的硬规矩，别用「看过了」代替「跑过了」。</li>\n</ol>\n";
